Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！誰... 誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:09.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,路過的英雄少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:11.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有時間了 我們快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:14.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,機場！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:14.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,機場！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.77,0:18:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你們...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:35.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,請抱牢我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.69,0:18:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪用得著提醒啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:50.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,再來一次！Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.89,0:18:52.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.12,0:18:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛... 飛起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:32.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:37.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亮太
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了？剛才電話裡還說“突然有急事”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:20:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶！愛...啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.09,0:20:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給她的禮物 第一雙鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:06.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:08.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,很漂亮的 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:10.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,虧得你們找到了同款鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:14.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,從機場到家裡路上的全部鞋店 我們都掃了一遍...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才這麼晚回來...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:17.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:20.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,沒... 沒什麼事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:26.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 這段日子受你照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.11,0:21:28.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你來按下按鈕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.67,0:21:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 記得帶特產回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:53.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.55,0:21:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:57.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Miracle哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1042,970)}奇蹟愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.95,0:22:13.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家來一起念咒語 Cure Up Rapapa！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:49.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,終於回到藍天大地了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.67,0:23:52.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空能回爸爸媽媽身邊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:55.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 太好了 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.38,0:23:56.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！那個人是！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.14,0:23:58.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？誰？誰啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:04.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,去藍天大地！再遇崇敬的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:14.44,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:20.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:25.58,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:33.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:38.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:42.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:44.18,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:48.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:53.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:55.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:59.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:03.58,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:06.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:09.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:09.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:14.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:19.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:24.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:29.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:32.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.35,0:02:40.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.02,0:22:30.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:35.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:38.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.03,0:22:39.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:42.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.68,0:22:45.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.14,0:22:47.10,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.10,0:22:49.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.85,0:22:52.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.56,0:22:54.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.36,0:22:56.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.04,0:23:03.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:09.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.29,0:23:11.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.34,0:23:16.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:20.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:26.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:30.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:34.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.78,0:23:38.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:39.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:42.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
